      {
        "id": "beat_1",
        "name": "Arrival at Blackwood Estate",
        "type": "introText",
        "position": {
          "x": 400,
          "y": 300
        },
        "parameters": {
          "text": "September 14th, 1923. The Blackwood Estate rises from the fog like a tombstone, all gables and broken promises. Mr. Howard Blackwood, textile magnate, claims his late father's mansion was robbed of 'priceless antiquities' worth a fortune in insurance money. The police called it an inside job. Blackwood's lawyer called me. Another boring fraud case to pay the rent, I figured. The butler greets you at the door, his face pale as parchment.",
          "buttonText": "Enter",
          "connection": {
            "target": "beat_2"
          }
        },
        "connections": [
          {
            "targetId": "beat_2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "beat_2",
        "name": "Initial Briefing",
        "type": "dialogTree",
        "position": {
          "x": 700,
          "y": 300
        },
        "parameters": {
          "dialogTree": {
            "id": "root",
            "speaker": "Butler",
            "text": "Mr. Blackwood will see you in the study. The robbery occurred three nights ago. The thieves took nothing else—only the collection from the east wing. Very... specific, they were.",
            "choices": [
              {
                "id": "c1",
                "text": "Sounds like an inside job. Who had access?",
                "target": "beat_3_hub"
              },
              {
                "id": "c2",
                "text": "What kind of 'antiquities' are we talking about?",
                "target": "beat_4_clue"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "beat_3_hub",
        "name": "Main Hall Hub",
        "type": "movementChoice",
        "position": {
          "x": 1000,
          "y": 300
        },
        "parameters": {
          "question": "The butler leaves you in the main hall. Where do you investigate?",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "text": "Study - Interview Blackwood",
              "target": "beat_5_blackwood"
            },
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "text": "East Wing - Crime Scene",
              "target": "beat_6_eastwing"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3",
              "text": "Library - Research the collection",
              "target": "beat_7_library"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "beat_4_clue",
        "name": "Strange Antiquities",
        "type": "introText",
        "position": {
          "x": 1000,
          "y": 450
        },
        "parameters": {
          "text": "The butler's eyes dart away. 'Artifacts from the old world, Mr. Cross. Mr. Blackwood's father was... an eccentric collector. Statues, scrolls, things best left undescribed.' He wrings his hands. 'The police laughed at the inventory list.'",
          "buttonText": "Continue",
          "connection": {
            "target": "beat_3_hub"
          }
        },
        "connections": [
          {
            "targetId": "beat_3_hub"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "beat_5_blackwood",
        "name": "Interview with Blackwood",
        "type": "dialogTree",
        "position": {
          "x": 1300,
          "y": 150
        },
        "parameters": {
          "dialogTree": {
            "id": "root",
            "speaker": "Howard Blackwood",
            "text": "The thieves took the Star Charts of Carcosa, the Mask of Y'ha-nthlei, and seven volumes of the Livre d'Eibon. My father's obsession with the occult was his undoing. I simply want what I'm owed.",
            "choices": [
              {
                "id": "c1",
                "text": "Those sound like mythological items, not real artifacts.",
                "dialogNode": {
                  "id": "c1_response",
                  "speaker": "Blackwood",
                  "text": "I assure you, Mr. Cross, they were very real. And very dangerous. Father believed they could... commune with something beyond the stars. I kept them locked away for good reason.",
                  "choices": [
                    {
                      "id": "c1a",
                      "text": "I'll need to see the crime scene.",
                      "target": "beat_6_eastwing"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "c1b",
                      "text": "Do you have any documentation?",
                      "target": "beat_7_library"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "c2",
                "text": "You seem nervous about more than the insurance money.",
                "dialogNode": {
                  "id": "c2_response",
                  "speaker": "Blackwood",
                  "text": "My father died in that wing. They found him in a locked room, his face frozen in... ecstasy? Terror? The coroner couldn't say. The symbols he carved into his own flesh told a story no sane man would believe.",
                  "choices": [
                    {
                      "id": "c2a",
                      "text": "Symbols? Show me.",
                      "target": "beat_8_symbols"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "c2b",
                      "text": "I think I need a drink first.",
                      "target": "beat_9_drink"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
