        "name": "East Wing Crime Scene",
        "type": "hyperText",
        "position": {
          "x": 1300,
          "y": 300
        },
        "parameters": {
          "text": "The east wing smells of ozone and decay. Glass cases lie shattered, but the strangest detail is the pattern of destruction—perfect circles of ash on the floor, as if the artifacts simply ceased to exist. You notice strange markings on the wall and a journal half-burnt in the fireplace.",
