      {
        "id": "beat_10_markings",
        "name": "Wall Markings",
        "type": "introText",
        "position": {
          "x": 1600,
          "y": 300
        },
        "parameters": {
          "text": "The markings aren't paint—they're burned into the plaster. They form a spiral pattern that seems to recede infinitely. At the center, a phrase in Latin: 'Quando cadunt tenebrae, aperitur via.' When the shadows fall, the way is opened. You hear whispers that aren't quite words.",
          "buttonText": "Copy the phrase",
          "connection": {
            "target": "beat_15_latin_knowledge"
          }
        },
        "connections": [
          {
            "targetId": "beat_15_latin_knowledge"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "beat_11_journal",
        "name": "Burnt Journal",
        "type": "introText",
        "position": {
          "x": 1600,
          "y": 350
        },
        "parameters": {
          "text": "The journal belonged to the elder Blackwood. One passage is legible: 'The Gatekeepers demand tribute. Seven souls for seven stars. The alignment approaches. Howard must not know what I've promised in his name. The children of the water will come to collect.'",
          "buttonText": "Hide the journal",
          "connection": {
            "target": "beat_16_journal_knowledge"
          }
        },
        "connections": [
          {
            "targetId": "beat_16_journal_knowledge"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "beat_12_catalog",
        "name": "Insurance Catalog",
        "type": "introText",
        "position": {
          "x": 1600,
          "y": 450
        },
        "parameters": {
          "text": "The catalog lists the stolen items with appraisals. But each entry has a footnote: 'WARNING: Do not appraise under moonlight. Do not allow to be photographed. Do not speak names aloud.' The handwriting is Blackwood's father's. The appraisals are absurdly low for 'priceless' items.",
          "buttonText": "Note the warnings",
          "connection": {
            "target": "beat_17_catalog_knowledge"
          }
        },
        "connections": [
          {
            "targetId": "beat_17_catalog_knowledge"
