          "x": 1600,
          "y": 750
        },
        "parameters": {
          "text": "You stumble through the fog, whiskey slowing your legs. Behind you, the mansion groans like a living thing. Something wet drags itself across the threshold. You reach your car but drop the keys. As you fumble, you see tentacles of shadow reaching from the house. The engine turns over. You peel away, not looking back.",
