        "name": "Ritual Complete",
        "type": "introText",
        "position": {
          "x": 1900,
          "y": 650
        },
        "parameters": {
          "text": "You speak the unspeakable name. Reality tears like paper. You stand between worlds, seeing the true shape of things—the tentacled, branched horror that wears Blackwood's skin. You seal the gate with your blood. The mansion screams. Blackwood's body collapses into salt water. You've saved the world, but the memory of what you saw... it doesn't fade.",
